MoU with North Eastern States During the
year 2025-26 (as on 15.01.2026), an amount
of 10.07 crore has been released to 7 North
Eastern States namely Arunachal Pradesh,
Manipur, Meghalaya, Mizoram, Nagaland,
Sikkim and Tripura under Work Plan 2025-
26. The MoU framework focuses on the following key
areas;
• Strengthening Enforcement and Compliance;
• Improving the Food Testing Ecosystem;
• Capacity Building and Training Programs;
and
• Promotion of FSSAI Initiatives.

